    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On weekends and after dinner, many people in Guangrao County, Shandong, like to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stop by",
            "ref": "v-stop-by"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " claw machine shops. Bright lights, cheerful music, and rows of plush toys "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "attract",
            "ref": "v-attract"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " kids and families every day. Players "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "crowd",
            "ref": "v-crowd"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " around the machines, hoping to grab their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "favorite",
            "ref": "v-favorite"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "prizes",
            "ref": "v-prize"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It’s simple, exciting, and full of surprises. “This kind of light entertainment "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fits",
            "ref": "v-fit-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " perfectly "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "with",
            "ref": "v-fit-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " young people. They love "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "instant happiness",
            "zh": "即时快乐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and share fun moments with friends,” an insider said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Guess what? This fun "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hobby",
            "ref": "v-hobby"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has grown into a 500-billion-"
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " industry! But the game is played very differently in big cities and small towns."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In big cities, the machines are full of cool toys like Disney dolls or POP MART figures. Each toy "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "costs",
            "ref": "v-cost"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 30–80 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and one try costs 2–5 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". People play for excitement and the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "thrill",
            "zh": "兴奋"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of winning something "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rare",
            "zh": "稀有的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". After they win, they love to take photos and share them online."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In small towns, the machines are different. They have useful things like snack gift boxes or "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Bluetooth earphones",
            "zh": "蓝牙耳机"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Each prize costs only 5–20 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and one try costs just 1–2 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "success rate",
            "zh": "成功率"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is as high as 30%—much higher than in big cities! That means you have a real "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chance",
            "ref": "v-chance"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to win."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "No matter where you play, claw machines are quick and easy. Next time you try to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "grab",
            "zh": "抓取"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a toy, remember: you’re not just having fun—you’re part of a big, exciting “claw "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "economy",
            "ref": "v-economy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
